# San Juan Island Fire and Rescue

> San Juan Island Fire and Rescue (SJIF&R) is a combination career/volunteer fire district providing fire, rescue, and marine emergency services to Friday Harbor and surrounding islands in San Juan County, Washington State.

## Overview

- **Official Name:** San Juan County Fire District #3
- **Common Name:** San Juan Island Fire and Rescue (SJIF&R)
- **Location:** Friday Harbor, San Juan Island, Washington, USA
- **Service Area:** San Juan Island, Brown Island, Henry Island, Pearl Island, and surrounding waters
- **Type:** Combination career and volunteer fire department
- **Website:** {{ site.prodUrl }}

## Services Provided

- Emergency Services (fire, rescue, EMS, marine response)
- Burn Permits (outdoor burning regulations and permits)
- Wildfire Ready (wildfire preparedness resources)
- Firewise USA (community wildfire protection program)
- Knox Box (rapid entry system for first responders)
- Fire Alarms (alarm system guidelines and monitoring)

## Contact Information

- **Address:** 1011 Mullis Street, Friday Harbor, WA 98250
- **Non-Emergency Phone:** 360-378-5334
- **Emergency:** Call 911

